&lt;h2 id="what-is-useful-for-our-concept"&gt;What is useful for our concept&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The screw-terminal examples are closest to the current prototype idea: a central supply feeding repeated connection points.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>